.next/
out/
# …but keep the directory itself: the crate embeds it with rust-embed
# (#[folder = "frontend/out"]), which fails to compile if it is absent. That
# breaks every build of the node and python bindings, which depend on the
# parent crate by path.
!out/.gitkeep
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
